{"title":"Stirling PDF documentation","description":"Guides for Stirling PDF on Stirling Cloud, the desktop app and self-hosted servers.","unlisted":false,"space":"","layout":"home","article":"\n    <h1>Stirling PDF documentation</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">Stirling is a private, open-source PDF editor and processor for you and your agents. Read, edit and automate PDFs in your browser, on your own computer or on your own servers.</p>\n<h2 class=\"section-label\">Pick your setup</h2>\n<div class=\"cards cards-3\"><div class=\"card card-link\" data-accent=\"cloud\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Cloud/\">Cloud</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Stirling Cloud, in your browser with nothing to install. The quickest way to start.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\" data-accent=\"desktop\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Desktop/\">Desktop</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Install the editor on your own computer, on Windows, Mac and Linux. Works offline.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\" data-accent=\"server\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"3\" y=\"14\" width=\"18\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Server/\">Server</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Run Stirling on your own infrastructure, from a container to bare metal. Best for production and growing organisations.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"section-label\">Guides for every setup</h2>\n<div class=\"cards cards-2\"><div class=\"card card-link\" data-accent=\"tools\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v16a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9\"/><path d=\"M13 3v6h6\"/><path d=\"m17.5 11.5 3 3-4.5 4.5H13v-3z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Tools/\">User guide</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Guides for using Stirling, from single tools to everyday tasks.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\" data-accent=\"processor\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 2 4 14h7l-1 8 9-12h-7l1-8z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Processor/\">Processor</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Classify, standardise and route thousands of PDFs at once. Fully automated.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\" data-accent=\"mcp\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l1.9 5.1L19 10l-5.1 1.9L12 17l-1.9-5.1L5 10l5.1-1.9L12 3z\"/><path d=\"M19 15l.9 2.1L22 18l-2.1.9L19 21l-.9-2.1L16 18l2.1-.9L19 15z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/MCP/\">MCP</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Let Claude, GPT and other agents run Stirling tools for you.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Developers/\">Developers</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Every PDF operation, callable from your own code with the REST API.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<h2 class=\"section-label\">Get help</h2>\n<div class=\"cards cards-3 cards-compact\"><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3M12 17h.01\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Tools/FAQ/\">FAQ</a></div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H4l2.2-2.9A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Cn8pWhQRxZ\">Ask the community on Discord</a></div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"/><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/issues\">Report a bug on GitHub</a></div></div></div>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Getting%20Started.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"","pager":"<span></span><span></span>"}